  "description": "Find the number of non-negative integers x such that the factorial of x has exactly K trailing zeroes.",
  "target": 5,
  "pseudocode": "function trailingZeroes(n) {\n  let count = 0;\n  while (n >= 5) {\n    n = Math.floor(n / 5);\n    count += n;\n  }\n  return count;\n}\n\nlet left = 0, right = 5 * K;\nwhile (left <= right) {\n  let mid = Math.floor((left + right) / 2);\n  let val = trailingZeroes(mid);\n  if (val === K) return 5;\n  if (val < K) left = mid + 1;\n  else right = mid - 1;\n}\nreturn 0;",
